```

Here, PexObserve.ValueForViewing is to observe the values that are being compared for verification.

In the case of ArrayList.Contains(x), since the verification of boolean return values are not possible using PexObserve, an assertion using "Debug.Assert\(.*?\);" for verification would be added in the end to confirm if the return value is true, there should be at least one index that x can be found in.


